# LLM Configuration
# =================

# Primary provider: custom endpoint (recommended for production)
# Uncomment and set these for custom API:
LLM_API_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
LLM_API_KEY=gsk_xxxxxxxx
LLM_MODEL=llama-3.1-8b-instant

# Fallback: Ollama (local)
# Uncomment if you want local fallback:
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:1.5b

# Provider selection: auto | custom | ollama
# 'auto' tries custom first, falls back to Ollama
LLM_PROVIDER=auto

# For testing without API keys:
# LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
